<title>GERMANY: German grain trade seeks free mkt barley exports.</title>
<headline>German grain trade seeks free mkt barley exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders bid for the export of 9,000 tonnes of free market barley with rebates in a 15.73-24.57 Ecus a tonne range, the state grain intervention board BLE said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bids will be considered at the European Union's weekly cereals management committee meeting.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
